{% comment %}
  Product gallery arrow centering.
  The theme hardcodes .l4pr .swiper-button-nav to height:540px, so the round prev/next
  buttons vertically center on 540px instead of the actual product image. On tall square
  images the arrows end up above the middle. Letting the nav span the gallery
  (top:0; bottom:0; height:auto) restores true vertical centering. The :after circle keeps
  its own top:50%/margin-top:-22px, so it now lands on the real center.
  Desktop/tablet only; mobile uses a separate below-image arrow layout.
{% endcomment %}
<style>
@media only screen and (min-width:761px){
  #content .l4pr.aside-pager .swiper-button-nav{top:0!important;bottom:0!important;height:auto!important}
}
</style>
{% schema %}
{"name":"NC Gallery Fix","settings":[]}
{% endschema %}
